  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Semarang&#x2013;Demak Water Dialogues on Land Subsidence</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment supports the Building with Nature Indonesia programme by facilitating stakeholder engagement and dialogue processes to address land subsidence in the coastal zone of Semarang and Demak, Central Java. Through a series of workshops, roundtables, and consultations with government, private sector, and community stakeholders, the project will develop a shared roadmap to reduce groundwater extraction, promote sustainable water management, and identify feasible mitigation and adaptation measures to address subsidence by 2030.</narrative>
  </description>
